---
import { globalMarketsSimulation as simulation } from '~/data/globalMarketsSimulation'

const allocations = [
  {
    label: 'Average allocation',
    equities: simulation.buySide.averageAllocation.equities,
    cash: simulation.buySide.averageAllocation.cash,
  },
  {
    label: 'Final allocation',
    equities: simulation.buySide.finalAllocation.equities,
    cash: simulation.buySide.finalAllocation.cash,
  },
]
---

<figure class="gm-allocation not-prose">
  <div class="gm-allocation-header">
    <div>
      <p>Exposure management</p>
      <h3>Average versus final asset allocation</h3>
    </div>

    <div class="gm-allocation-legend" aria-label="Legend">
      <span class="gm-legend-equities">Equities</span>
      <span class="gm-legend-cash">Cash</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="gm-allocation-bars">
    {
      allocations.map((allocation) => (
        <div class="gm-allocation-row">
          <div class="gm-allocation-label">
            <strong>{allocation.label}</strong>
            <span>
              {allocation.equities.toFixed(1)}% equities ·{' '}
              {allocation.cash.toFixed(1)}% cash
            </span>
          </div>

          <div
            class="gm-stacked-bar"
            role="img"
            aria-label={`${allocation.label}: ${allocation.equities.toFixed(1)}% equities and ${allocation.cash.toFixed(1)}% cash`}
          >
            <span
              class="gm-bar-equities"
              style={`width: ${allocation.equities}%`}
            >
              {allocation.equities.toFixed(1)}%
            </span>
            <span class="gm-bar-cash" style={`width: ${allocation.cash}%`}>
              {allocation.cash.toFixed(1)}%
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))
    }
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    Equity exposure rose to {simulation.buySide.peakEquityAllocation} during the session
    and finished at 99.5% equities and 0.5% cash. The final allocation therefore records
    a highly concentrated end state rather than late-session de-risking. The bars
    use exact portal allocations; they are not a reconstructed time series.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gm-allocation {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.3rem 1.15rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0.55rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 2.8%, transparent);
  }

  .gm-allocation-header {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 11%, transparent);
  }

  .gm-allocation-header p {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.64rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    opacity: 0.46;
  }

  .gm-allocation h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, Cambria, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .gm-allocation-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex: none;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    opacity: 0.58;
  }

  .gm-allocation-legend span {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .gm-allocation-legend span::before {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 0.16rem;
    content: '';
  }

  .gm-legend-equities::before {
    background: #65d99d;
  }

  .gm-legend-cash::before {
    background: #86a7c5;
  }

  .gm-allocation-bars {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 1.15rem;
  }

  .gm-allocation-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.52rem;
  }

  .gm-allocation-label strong {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .gm-allocation-label span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .gm-stacked-bar {
    display: flex;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 2.25rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 3%, transparent);
  }

  .gm-stacked-bar span {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 0;
    padding-inline: 0.35rem;
    color: #07111b;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gm-bar-equities {
    background: #65d99d;
  }

  .gm-bar-cash {
    background: #a9c3db;
  }

  .gm-allocation figcaption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.52;
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .gm-allocation-header {
      display: block;
    }

    .gm-allocation-legend {
      margin-top: 0.8rem;
    }

    .gm-stacked-bar span {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
    }
  }
</style>
